== Traveling To and From ==

The Temple of Solusek Ro can be found by traveling through the zone of the [[Zone_Lavastorm_Mountains|Lavastorm Mountains]]. When you travel to the north middle of that zone, along the northern edge of the lava pit known as Solusek's Eye, there is a small walkway and a tunnel that leads into the Temple.

